worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_factual_qa.js"
  ceiling 948
  rationale "Grounded relation candidates share a subject parser and are ordered by the longest matching surface before the publisher is consulted. Relation definitions supply the display precision for publisher time claims. Issue #1580 adds seven lines for the longest seeded explanation cue and leading-only function-word removal, preserving internal words in the subject; rust/src/solver_handlers/fact_live_answer.rs implements the same operation."
